OL,3,AUK 'supports Ukraine 100%', Burnham
OL,4,Asays, after Russia's drone warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FUK Prime Minister Andy Burnham has said
OL,7,FLondon will continue "to support
OL,8,FUkraine 100%", after Moscow warned of
OL,9,F"consequences" following confirmation
OL,10,Fthat British-made drones were used in
OL,11,Frecent Ukrainian strikes in Russia.
OL,13,F"We are not fair-weather friends, we
OL,14,Fwill be there in Ukraine's hour of need
OL,15,Fand that won't change," he said.
OL,17,FThe Russian embassy in the UK earlier
OL,18,Faccused Britain of "deliberately opting
OL,19,Ffor an escalation of the Ukraine
OL,20,Fcrisis", saying "the deeper its
OL,21,Finvolvement in the conflict... the
OL,22,Fhigher the price it will pay".
